<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #333;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .header-info {
    font-size: 0.9em;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 1.5em;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .step-list {
    list-style-type: decimal;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }
  .step-list li {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .code-block {
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    padding: 10px;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    margin: 15px 0;
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", monospace;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-info">
    Title: Jabber Install and Setup Instructions<br>
    Intended Audience: <span data-field="intended_audience">{{ intended_audience }}</span><br>
    Summary: How to install the Jabber Application<br>
    Publication Date: <span data-field="publication_date">{{ publication_date }}</span><br>
    Author: <span data-field="author">{{ author }}</span><br>
    Contact Info: <span data-field="contact_info">{{ contact_info }}</span>
  </div>
  <h1 class="section-title">The Cisco Jabber Client is the preferred video client to interface with the <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> A & M University Video Telepresence System.</h1>

  <h2 class="section-title">FAMU Jabber Setup</h2>

  <ol class="step-list">
    <li>
      Download Jabber client (PC, Mac, iPad). The files can be download from the following locations:
      <ul>
        <li>PC: <span data-field="pc_download_link">{{ pc_download_link }}</span></li>
        <li>MAC: <span data-field="mac_download_link">{{ mac_download_link }}</span></li>
        <li>Ipad: <span data-field="ipad_download_link">{{ ipad_download_link }}</span></li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>
      Once the download is complete, Run App Wizard using the default settings.
    </li>
    <li>
      Open the App and enter the username and password you were sent by EIT Networking Administrators.
    </li>
  </ol>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 class="section-title">Installing Cisco Jabber on PC</h2>

  <ol class="step-list">
    <li>
      Copy the download to your hard drive. Double Click to install the application.
    </li>
    <li>
      Once the download is complete, Run App Wizard using the default settings.
    </li>
    <li>
      Open the App and enter the username and password you were sent by EIT Networking Administrators.
    </li>
  </ol>

  <h2 class="section-title">Jabber Video Setup</h2>

  <p>
    4. To setup Jabber the first time, Click the Settings Icon
  </p>
  <p>
    5. Enter the configuration information below. Click Ok.
  </p>

  <div class="code-block">
    <!-- Placeholder for visual representation of settings dialog -->
    <p>Settings Dialog Content Placeholder</p>
  </div>

  <ol class="step-list">
    <li>
      Click Sign-In.
    </li>
    <li>
      Test connection immediately by dialing sip address <span data-field="sip_address">{{ sip_address }}</span>. The EIT Networking Administrators will also test your the audio and video quality.
    </li>
    <li>
      Please call <span data-field="support_phone">{{ support_phone }}</span> for assistance.
    </li>
  </ol>
</div>